abstract: |
  Formal proof repository for the paper "从T^64拓扑到三代费米子：代际数字'3'的本体论必然性证明".
  Contains Lean 4 and Coq formalizations proving that the three generations of fermions
  are a topological necessity derived from the T^64 torus under TCSC constraints.
  
  Core theorem: 3 = (64 - 1)/21
